    Preserve mapper detection history across savestates
    
    Preserve the mapper-detection history required for deterministic decisions after savestate restoration.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate format to version 9 with 18 bits of saved-time mapper history, preventing post-save detection activity from leaking across LOAD operations.
    
    Make repeated loads restore identical mapper state and future ROM/RAM mapping while retaining deterministic compatibility with older snapshots.
    
    Add mapper-boundary, repeated-load, CPU-visible data, and existing mapper regression coverage.

